{
  "language": "en-gb",
  "voice": "bm_george",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "v01",
      "text": "Right now, your phone knows where you are, to within a few metres.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 0.9,
      "duration": 3.86,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v02a",
      "text": "It works it out by listening",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 5.7,
      "duration": 1.951,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v02b",
      "text": "to ticking clocks.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 8,
      "duration": 1.324,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v03",
      "text": "About thirty satellites circle twenty thousand kilometres above us.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 14.2,
      "duration": 4.503,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v04",
      "text": "Each one carries an atomic clock, and broadcasts the time, over and over.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 19.1,
      "duration": 4.799,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v05",
      "text": "The signal travels at the speed of light, but it still arrives a little late.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 24.6,
      "duration": 4.479,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v06",
      "text": "And that delay is a distance.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 30.3,
      "duration": 2.149,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v07",
      "text": "One satellite puts you somewhere on a circle.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 34.9,
      "duration": 2.8,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v08",
      "text": "Two, at one of two points.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 0.96,
      "start": 38.1,
      "duration": 1.722,
      "language": "en-gb",
      "delivery_note": "Articulate AT distinctly after the opening Two; keep the exact words and existing cue window.",
      "delivery_segments": [
        "Two,",
        "at one of two points."
      ],
      "segment_pause": 0.06
    },
    {
      "id": "v09a",
      "text": "Three.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 40.3,
      "duration": 0.728,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v09b",
      "text": "Right here.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 41.68,
      "duration": 0.985,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v10",
      "text": "But, there's a catch.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 44.4,
      "duration": 1.366,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v11",
      "text": "Up there, time itself runs at a different speed.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 46.6,
      "duration": 3.174,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v12",
      "text": "Moving fast slows the orbiting clock, by seven microseconds a day.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 56.3,
      "duration": 4.881,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v13",
      "text": "Weaker gravity speeds it up, by forty-five.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 61.7,
      "duration": 3.166,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v14",
      "text": "Together, thirty-eight microseconds fast. Every single day.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 65.3,
      "duration": 4.192,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v15",
      "text": "Sounds tiny. But in thirty-eight microseconds, light travels over eleven kilometres.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 70,
      "duration": 6.043,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v16",
      "text": "Left alone, your map pin would drift that far, every day.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 76.5,
      "duration": 3.766,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v17",
      "text": "By next week, you'd be somewhere out at sea.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 80.9,
      "duration": 2.73,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v18",
      "text": "So before launch, engineers tune the satellite clocks to tick slightly slow.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 88.9,
      "duration": 4.98,
      "language": "en-gb"
    },
    {
      "id": "v19",
      "text": "Einstein's relativity, quietly at work in your pocket.",
      "voice": "bm_george",
      "speed": 1.0,
      "start": 96,
      "duration": 3.764,
      "language": "en-gb"
    }
  ]
}
